docs {
  # Get Project API
  
  Inertia edit page for Public API CORS origins (`public_api_allowed_origins`).
  
  **Method:** GET  
  **Endpoint:** `{{base_url}}/settings/project/api`  
  **Route name:** `project.api.edit`  
  **Permission:** `CanManageProjectSettings`  
  **Auth:** session cookie
  
  Requires externa-core with #201 merged (section routes). Saving this section clears the CORS origins cache; other sections do not.
  
  Link card on the page points to Access → API Keys (scopes live there, not here).
}
